# EE WiFi Project Structure Guide

This is a comprehensive WiFi monitoring and management system with multiple components:

## Core Monitoring Scripts
- [internet_monitor.py](mdc:internet_monitor.py) - Main internet connectivity monitor
- [internet_logbook.py](mdc:internet_logbook.py) - Logbook management system
- [wifi_hotspot_agent.py](mdc:wifi_hotspot_agent.py) - WiFi hotspot management agent
- [check_monitor_status.py](mdc:check_monitor_status.py) - Monitor status checker

## Web Server Components
- [web_server.py](mdc:web_server.py) - Python HTTP server for port 80
- [start_port80_server.py](mdc:start_port80_server.py) - Simplified port 80 server
- [kill_port80_and_start_server.py](mdc:kill_port80_and_start_server.py) - Port management script

## Cloudflare Tunnel Integration
- [cloudflared.exe](mdc:cloudflared.exe) - Cloudflare tunnel client
- [reinstall_cloudflared.ps1](mdc:reinstall_cloudflared.ps1) - Service reinstallation script
- [reinstall_cloudflared.bat](mdc:reinstall_cloudflared.bat) - Batch reinstallation script

## WiFi Reporting System
- [wifi_report.py](mdc:wifi_report.py) - Main WiFi report generator
- [wifi_report.cmd](mdc:wifi_report.cmd) - Command-line interface
- [wifi_report_function.ps1](mdc:wifi_report_function.ps1) - PowerShell function

## Configuration Files
- [wifi_config.json](mdc:wifi_config.json) - Main WiFi configuration
- [wifi_config_template.json](mdc:wifi_config_template.json) - Configuration template
- [requirements.txt](mdc:requirements.txt) - Python dependencies

## Log Files
- [internet_connectivity_records.txt](mdc:internet_connectivity_records.txt) - Connectivity event log
- [internet_monitor.log](mdc:internet_monitor.log) - Monitor activity log
- [wifi_agent.log](mdc:wifi_agent.log) - WiFi agent log

## Startup Scripts
- [start_monitor.bat](mdc:start_monitor.bat) - Windows batch startup
- [start_monitor.ps1](mdc:start_monitor.ps1) - PowerShell startup
- [setup_autostart.bat](mdc:setup_autostart.bat) - Auto-start configuration